WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Preview Thunderbolt: enemies start the next battle at 70% HP.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Cancel, then reopen the same offering preview.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Confirmation changes deck capacity from 25 to 20.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The prepared benefit remains visible on the map.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.500
Choose the next reachable battle.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.730
The battle loads with enemies at 45 of 64 HP.

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:32.000
Combat begins; cards spend elixir while attacks continue.
